 "note": "R112 - pair-class structure of every league-stem schedule table beyond NHL / AHL / Swiss (receipt 2026-09-26 next task), on the real\nNHL 20, NHL 21 and X360 Legacy sources (hash-checked as in R111). League resolution, never a guessed id:\n  PS4   : table stem -> `stockleagues.name` key (explicit map below, each key read from the title's own stockleagues rows);\n  Legacy: no stockleagues table -> the league of a named member club (map below; club names are shipped fullname strings).\nPer table: members, games, games per team, pairs, games-per-pair by relationship (same division / same conference / other conference, using\nthe league's own group fields as R13), home/away imbalance, slots beyond the member count, a 'single class rule' flag, and - where every\npair plays the same count or two counts - the graph of the higher count (components / cliques), as for Swiss. Observed data only.\nUsage: python r112_league_schedule_formats.py <out.json>\n",
